the artifact's fixed primary harness\")\n202:class SemanticCheck(Record):\n214:    challenged_components: list[RepairComponent] = Field(default_factory=list,\n218:class SemanticReview(Record):\n219:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n231:class ReviewIssue(Record):\n237:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n250:class ExecutionStatus(str, Enum):\n262:class Assessment(str, Enum):\n270:class Investigation(str, Enum):\n275:class Origin(str, Enum):\n285:class Scope(Record):\n292:class Grounding(Record):\n293:    source_ids: list[str] = Field(default_factory=list, description=\"Exact IDs of acquired implementation source materials; not Behavior or Binding IDs\")\n294:    expectation_ids: list[str] = Field(default_factory=list, description=\"Exact IDs of acquired materials supporting the expectation; not invented expectation labels. Explain normative applicability in derivation.\")\n303:class CheckerResult(Record):\n311:class PendingAction(Record):\n313:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n322:class Claim(Record):\n338:class CodeAnchor(Record):\n348:class BindingAssociation(Record):\n354:class AssociatedCode(Record):\n359:class Binding(AssociatedCode):\n381:class DirectCheckArtifact(Record):\n382:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n397:class CheckRun(Record):\n399:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n415:    artifacts: list[str] = []\n427:class Evidence(Record):\n430:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n445:class Finding(Record):\n447:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n460:class Relation(Record):\n461:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n473:class Snapshot(Record):\n474:    id: str = Field(default_factory=uid)\n481:    created_at: str = Field(default_factory=now)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
